# question: How many distinct patients have a recorded relationship identified as Younger sister (SNOMED CT 19686009) while ensuring none of the sequencing assays performed were patch clamp assays (OBI 0002177), reporter gene assays for epitope-specific interleukin-2 production by T cells (OBI 0001402), or 24-hour urine protein assays (OBI 2100262)?
# expected_compliant: true
# expected_rules: none
# origin: train
# notes: PREFIX sphn: <https://biomedit.ch/rdf/sphn-schema/sphn#> PREFIX snomed: <http://snomed.info/id/> PREFIX obi: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_> PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> SELECT (COUNT(DISTINCT ?g) AS ?patients) WHERE { GRAPH ?g { ?a a sphn:Performer ; sphn:hasCode ?a_c . ?a_c rdf:type snomed:19686009 OPTION (inference "https://biomedit.ch/rdf/sphn-resource/global") . } FILTER NOT EXISTS { GRAPH ?g { ?b a sphn:SequencingAssay ; sphn:hasCode ?b_c . { ?b_c rdf:type obi:0002177 OPTION (inference "https://biomedit.ch/rdf/sphn-resource/global") } UNION { ?b_c rdf:type obi:0001402 OPTION (inference "https://biomedit.ch/rdf/sphn-resource/global") } UNION { ?b_c rdf:type obi:2100262 OPTION (inference "https://biomedit.ch/rdf/sphn-resource/global") } } } }
